  "finding": {
   "question": "Is there a character named Uncle Chang in the film Song of the South?",
   "answer": "The search results do not mention any character named Uncle Chang in Song of the South. Earlier evidence identifies the elderly storyteller character in the film as Uncle Remus, not Uncle Chang.",
   "source": "Song of the South - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Song_of_the_South",
